  "details": "For a few days now, the default settings for the instance type of my private homeworld (not published) no longer apply. The instance is always created as \"Invite,\" even though the default type is set to \"Friends.\"\n\nIf I set a published world as my homeworld, the default type works correctly again.\n\nThe problem first caught my attention two days ago.\n\nCurrently, I always have to manually reopen the world as a Friends Lobby.\n\nBuild:\n\n2024.4.1p4-1538-c5eb5d8aff-Release",
